      "id": "claim_69cdfa93177840f48d713cafd29ff7df",
      "statement": "`docRecordFor(batch, key)` in `modules/documents/domain/compliance.ts` returns the record or `null`, and that single `null` is the fork every surface consumes: measurement excludes it, gating treats it as unsatisfied.",
